~~ROW COUNT: 1~~

prepst#!#exec#!#GEOMETRY|-|location|-|POLYGON ((1 1,4 5, 6 7, 1 1)):4326
~~ROW COUNT: 1~~

prepst#!#exec#!#GEOMETRY|-|location|-|POLYGON ((1 1 2, 1 2 3, 2 2 4, 1 1 2)):4326
~~ROW COUNT: 1~~

prepst#!#exec#!#GEOMETRY|-|location|-|POLYGON ((1 1 2, 1 2  NULL 3, 2 2 4, 1 1 NULL 2)):4326
~~ROW COUNT: 1~~

prepst#!#exec#!#GEOMETRY|-|location|-|POLYGON ((1 1 2 4, 1 2 3 5, 2 2 4 6, 1 1 2 7)):4326
~~ROW COUNT: 1~~

prepst#!#exec#!#GEOMETRY|-|location|-|POLYGON ((1 1, 1 2, 2 2, 1 1),(0 0, 10 0, 10 10, 0 10, 0 0)):4326
~~ROW COUNT: 1~~

